  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When half of Fang Yuan’s myriad self army turns on him, Hei Cheng snorts coldly and wills several mortal killer moves together, this one with Dark Fire and Black Wind Break. The army answers with a kill charge; in several breaths the demons cry, the dark fire dims, and the black winds dissipate. His confident look breaks as he judges the army’s power an immortal killer move, and the press into his dark veil soon forces him to retreat.",
